<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">64 Palms!</font>

33
00:02:23,910 --> 00:02:25,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on?!</font>

34
00:02:41,140 --> 00:02:43,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A golden body surface...?</font>

35
