<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was close.</font>

37
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:17,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hear that if you're hit straight on
with Gentle Fist</font>

38
00:03:18,010 --> 00:03:19,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your Chakra Network gets damaged</font>

39
00:03:19,470 --> 00:03:21,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and you become unable
to build up Chakra...</font>

40
00:03:22,140 --> 00:03:23,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was close.</font>

41
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:27,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you a monster?</font>

42
00:03:28,140 --> 00:03:30,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems to come
not just from your mouth.</font>

43
00:03:32,270 --> 00:03:34,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gum Style Spider Thread...</font>

44
00:03:34,270 --> 00:03:37,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is a metal that hardens
the instant it leaves my body.</font>

45
00:03:38,110 --> 00:03:40,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover it doesn't let Chakra through.</font>

46
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:46,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... it can be secreted
not just from my mouth</font>

47
00:03:46,410 --> 00:03:49,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but also from the sweat glands
throughout my body.</font>

48
00:03:59,210 --> 00:04:04,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Attacks on Chakra points won't work.
Now it makes sense...</font>

49
00:04:12,480 --> 00:04:14,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Spider Web Net won't work.</font>

50
00:04:14,810 --> 00:04:16,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And there'll be no close-range
combat fighting</font>

51
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:18,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">against a Gentle Fist opponent.</font>

52
00:04:18,570 --> 00:04:19,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,</font>

53
00:04:19,780 --> 00:04:22,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just have to attack the blind side
from long distance.</font>

54
00:05:12,870 --> 00:05:16,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There'll be no sound...
It'll be in a flash.</font>

55
00:05:24,090 --> 00:05:26,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The game's over.</font>

56
00:05:30,350 --> 00:05:31,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Kunai Knife is a fake!</font>

57
00:05:38,150 --> 00:05:39,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

58
00:05:39,940 --> 00:05:41,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">8 Trigrams Palm...</font>

59
