<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does he... have eyes behind him?!</font>

62
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:11,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the defense just now...</font>

63
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:15,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He repelled physical attacks
with Chakra?!</font>

64
00:06:17,270 --> 00:06:23,570
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">{360 degree</font>

65
00:06:17,270 --> 00:06:23,570
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">{Vision</font>

66
00:06:17,270 --> 00:06:23,570
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">{The</font>

67
00:06:17,270 --> 00:06:23,570
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">{Byaku-</font>

68
00:06:17,270 --> 00:06:23,570
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">{gan's Blind Spot</font>

69
00:06:34,370 --> 00:06:36,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we're not prepared for
"one person, one kill",</font>

70
00:06:36,830 --> 00:06:38,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then it's not going to work out...</font>

71
00:06:39,710 --> 00:06:41,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what you said earlier.</font>

72
00:06:42,710 --> 00:06:47,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and go!
I'll catch up with you all!</font>

73
00:06:52,220 --> 00:06:54,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have to be prepared for
"one person, one kill."</font>

74
00:06:56,020 --> 00:06:57,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

75
00:06:58,270 --> 00:07:01,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've got better eyes than me.</font>

76
00:07:04,020 --> 00:07:05,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji...</font>

77
00:07:05,820 --> 00:07:07,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Catch up with us no matter what!</font>

78
00:07:21,420 --> 00:07:23,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can he see me?!</font>

79
00:07:25,170 --> 00:07:27,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell is he?!</font>

80
00:07:29,380 --> 00:07:31,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know you're there.</font>

81
00:07:32,550 --> 00:07:33,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come out.</font>

82
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:35,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those eyes...</font>

83
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:39,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems they can do more
than just see through the Chakra flow...</font>

84
00:07:40,850 --> 00:07:43,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I see there was
an extraordinary Visual Jutsu user.</font>

85
00:07:45,190 --> 00:07:47,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A long range battle
is unfavorable...</font>

86
00:07:48,070 --> 00:07:51,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must bring this to
close combat by all means.</font>

87
00:07:51,860 --> 00:07:52,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Very well.</font>

88
00:07:57,790 --> 00:08:03,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll acknowledge that this game has
a somewhat high level of difficulty!</font>

89
00:08:04,670 --> 00:08:06,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I too shall go for it seriously...</font>

90
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:13,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's like he's a totally different person
from before...</font>

91
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His Chakra activity is overwhelming.</font>

92
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:19,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And those markings...</font>

93
00:08:27,270 --> 00:08:29,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His move earlier...</font>

94
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:31,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He dodged an attack aimed
from behind</font>

95
00:08:31,400 --> 00:08:33,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and was able to see me hiding
in the shadows.</font>

96
00:08:35,490 --> 00:08:36,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,</font>

97
00:08:37,070 --> 00:08:40,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he has a combined wide range
of sight and X-ray vision.</font>

98
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:43,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And what's more that Jutsu...</font>

99
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:45,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If so...</font>

100
00:08:50,170 --> 00:08:51,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu!</font>

101
00:08:59,470 --> 00:09:01,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your ability...</font>

102
00:09:01,850 --> 00:09:05,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll find a way to impeccably assault it.</font>

103
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:15,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he defends
against physical attacks</font>

104
00:09:16,070 --> 00:09:19,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with a large emission
of Chakra and its Rotation...</font>

105
00:09:19,490 --> 00:09:23,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">all I need to do then is to stop
that Chakra Rotation!</font>

106
00:09:25,710 --> 00:09:26,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Scatter!</font>

107
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:38,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rotation!</font>

108
00:09:48,270 --> 00:09:49,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's starting to stop.</font>

109
00:09:58,490 --> 00:09:59,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here!</font>

110
00:10:10,790 --> 00:10:11,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!</font>

111
00:10:24,310 --> 00:10:27,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He released the Chakra just in time
and repelled the Kunai Knife!</font>

112
00:10:31,610 --> 00:10:33,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think he'd stop my Chakra Rotation</font>

113
00:10:33,110 --> 00:10:35,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by binding it with Chakra threads...</font>

114
00:10:36,110 --> 00:10:37,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These things...</font>

115
00:10:38,530 --> 00:10:39,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just have to cut them for now.</font>

116
00:10:42,660 --> 00:10:44,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the Rotation won't do</font>

117
00:10:44,370 --> 00:10:46,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then I just have to dodge
each and every one.</font>

118
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:51,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy uses
close-range Taijutsu-style combat.</font>

119
00:10:51,250 --> 00:10:53,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There will be no problem
if I fight him from afar.</font>

120
00:10:56,300 --> 00:10:59,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that way...
I'll have a good long look at your ability.</font>

121
00:11:29,330 --> 00:11:32,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">8 Trigrams 64 Palms!</font>

122
00:11:40,300 --> 00:11:41,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a number!</font>

123
00:12:02,610 --> 00:12:05,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hm?! His stance changed?!</font>

124
00:12:06,410 --> 00:12:07,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">8 Trigrams.</font>

125
00:12:08,410 --> 00:12:10,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">128 Palms!</font>

126
00:12:22,680 --> 00:12:25,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's fast!
The number of strikes has doubled...!</font>

127
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:29,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I get nailed by that straight on
it'll be the end for me.</font>

128
00:12:30,220 --> 00:12:32,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that's the case on his end,</font>

129
00:12:32,310 --> 00:12:34,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then it'll be a battle of numbers
on this end too!</font>

130
00:12:52,330 --> 00:12:55,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The number's too great!
I won't have enough time!</font>

131
00:13:02,170 --> 00:13:04,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Rotation's no good
just as I thought...</font>

132
00:13:17,650 --> 00:13:20,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems he has 360-degree vision.</font>

133
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:23,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And it seems he deals
with enemy attacks</font>

134
00:13:23,570 --> 00:13:27,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by combining his X-ray vision ability
for seeing through things</font>

135
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:30,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and his telescopic vision ability
for long-distance sight.</font>

136
00:13:31,790 --> 00:13:36,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Furthermore, although
he's got 360-degree vision</font>

137
00:13:36,580 --> 00:13:38,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that vision has a formidable extent...</font>

138
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:44,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I were to determine the range
from his reaction before...</font>

139
00:13:44,380 --> 00:13:46,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he almost unfailingly detected
the Kunai Knives</font>

140
00:13:46,680 --> 00:13:52,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that entered the approximately
150-foot circumference around him.</font>

141
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:56,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But for some reason</font>

142
00:13:56,730 --> 00:13:59,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there are Kunai Knives
he can't evade completely.</font>

143
00:14:00,560 --> 00:14:01,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If so...</font>

144
00:14:08,740 --> 00:14:11,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">8 Trigrams Sixty...</font>

145
00:14:16,910 --> 00:14:18,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

146
00:14:31,600 --> 00:14:33,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time there'll be even more.</font>

147
00:14:42,400 --> 00:14:44,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time two will hit...</font>

148
00:15:05,500 --> 00:15:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've found a way to impeccably
assault your ability!</font>

149
00:15:09,930 --> 00:15:12,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems that defense technique</font>

150
00:15:12,340 --> 00:15:15,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was something to compensate
for this weak point!</font>

151
00:15:17,140 --> 00:15:22,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words...
Your Visual Jutsu isn't perfect!</font>

152
00:15:32,740 --> 00:15:37,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why even bother?!
I've won the game!</font>

153
00:15:47,420 --> 00:15:51,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on. Are you going to
keep at it for nothing?</font>

154
00:15:52,550 --> 00:15:57,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The fate of the small fry character in an
easy game is to be destroyed right away!</font>

155
00:16:00,520 --> 00:16:02,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't beat me!</font>

156
00:16:09,690 --> 00:16:11,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I-I'm not done yet.
— Lee...</font>

157
00:16:12,280 --> 00:16:15,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You never give up do you?</font>

158
00:16:15,240 --> 00:16:20,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way you can beat him.
He's a genius unlike you.</font>

159
00:16:21,750 --> 00:16:24,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Genius? What is genius anyway!</font>

160
00:16:24,420 --> 00:16:28,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even without any talent
I'll surpass "genius" by working hard.</font>

161
00:16:28,550 --> 00:16:30,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no use, Lee.</font>

162
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:35,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how hard you work
you cannot beat me.</font>

163
00:16:36,600 --> 00:16:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's already decided.</font>

164
00:16:38,970 --> 00:16:40,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata-sama...</font>

165
00:16:40,310 --> 00:16:43,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the sheltered little baby
of the main branch.</font>

166
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:46,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A person can never change.</font>

167
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:50,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then this match...</font>

168
00:16:50,320 --> 00:16:54,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your destiny was decided at the point
when I became your opponent.</font>

169
00:16:57,740 --> 00:17:01,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't know until you try!</font>

170
00:17:05,620 --> 00:17:07,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the end...</font>

171
00:17:36,320 --> 00:17:37,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gentle Fist!</font>

172
00:17:47,080 --> 00:17:51,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Small fry character one...
Destruction completed.</font>

173
00:18:13,530 --> 00:18:17,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, for a crummy game
I was entertained...</font>

174
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:09,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh... I missed the fatal spots, huh?</font>

175
00:19:10,210 --> 00:19:15,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And he wouldn't easily die from
Kunai Knives from 150 feet away, eh?</font>

176
00:19:18,050 --> 00:19:21,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...
He's still going to entertain me, huh?</font>

177
00:19:23,600 --> 00:19:25,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is thanks for that.</font>

178
00:19:39,280 --> 00:19:42,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seriously, that fat Jirobo
can't be helped</font>

179
00:19:42,320 --> 00:19:44,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but what's that idiot Kidomaru
doing anyway...?</font>

180
00:19:45,080 --> 00:19:46,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That lowlife!</font>

181
00:19:47,200 --> 00:19:50,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's got the habit of playing games.</font>

182
00:19:50,460 --> 00:19:53,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe he's found someone
to entertain him?</font>

183
00:19:53,460 --> 00:19:55,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When that idiot plays too much</font>

184
00:19:55,420 --> 00:19:59,050
