185
00:20:02,180 --> 00:20:05,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But still...
Once he gets to the second state...</font>

186
00:20:05,720 --> 00:20:07,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's instant death for the opponent.</font>

187
00:20:37,250 --> 00:20:45,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maximum destructive power...
